  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal would fail to promote sustainable modes of transport and would result in conditions prejudicial to pedestrian and highway safety by virtue of the failure to demonstrate 25-metre driver visibility splays, the excessive width of the proposed crossover, and the location of the site on a busy road, near to a school. Therefore the proposal would be contrary to London Plan policy T6.1 and Local Plan policy EC2 and the Council's adopted Residential Crossover and Off-Street Parking Policy"
